  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Thinking of studying medicine in the Caribbean? St. Matthew's University School of Medicine is a great choice. St. Matthew's University School of Medicine is a private medical university located in Grand Cayman, Cayman Islands.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Life at St. Matthew’s is close-knit. With smaller class sizes, you’ll quickly get to know your peers and professors. Here, you can expect collaborative study sessions, faculty mentorship, and a strong academic routine. Plus, you’ll also meet students from across the world, creating a global classroom.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>St. Matthew’s University does not offer on-campus housing. However, the university assists students in finding safe, furnished off-campus accommodation nearby.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The university’s library is a modern, technologically equipped facility, with access to extensive eJournals, databases, and textbooks.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>Through student clubs, you can join casual sports like pickleball and basketball.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>On campus, you’ll find many modern labs, including the Clinical Skills lab and Microbiology lab.</p>",
      "image": null,
